<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <!--
    Companion gene for the thanatic reactor hediff. NOT player-assignable.
    Managed entirely by Hediff_ThanaticReactor (added on install, removed on uninstall).

    Purpose (dual role):
      1. Consistency with every other AAH hardware part — each installed part has
         a companion gene so it renders in VREA's gene inspector with the archite
         background and participates in the AAH_Hardware display category.
      2. biostatMet -4 drives accelerated drain through VREA's
         PowerEfficiencyToPowerDrainFactorCurve, which maps the pawn's summed
         gene biostatMet to a drain factor (anchors we've observed: met 0 →
         1.0×, met -20 → 6.0×; the curve's exact shape in between is VREA's,
         so the effective multiplier at met -4 isn't one we can state
         precisely here). The Thanatic hediff does no drain scaling of its
         own — tuning knob is the gene's biostatMet value; tune here if the
         realised drain rate feels off in play.

    Unlike other AAH hardware genes this one declares no exclusionTag: the
    Thanatic reactor doesn't suppress a VREA counterpart gene — VREA_Power must
    stay active so the ReactorPower need is enabled and the charge bar visible.

    canGenerateInGeneSet: false prevents this from appearing in xenotype creation.
    biostatArc > 0 is required for the archite gene background (see modExtensions).

    Background rendering: Uses VEF's GeneExtension.backgroundPathArchite instead of
    the standard endogenes/xenogenes background path. VEF's transpiler in
    GeneUIUtility.DrawGene selects this archite background when biostatArc > 0.

    Display: VREA's custom gene inspector only shows genes its Utils.IsAndroidGene
    check recognises. The Utils_IsAndroidGene patch extends that check to all
    AAH_Hardware-category genes, which also relabels biostatMet as "Power
    efficiency" and rolls it into the inspector's Power efficiency total.
  -->
  <GeneDef>
    <defName>AAH_ThanaticReactor</defName>
    <label>thanatic reactor</label>
    <description>Androids with this hardware run an archotech reactor that draws power from the psychic echoes of violence. It drains faster than a standard reactor and is recharged by the deaths of humanlikes at the host's hand. If it ever runs dry, the host dies.</description>
    <iconPath>UI/Icons/Genes/Hardware/Gene_ThanaticReactor</iconPath>
    <displayCategory>AAH_Hardware</displayCategory>
    <displayOrderInCategory>4</displayOrderInCategory>
    <canGenerateInGeneSet>false</canGenerateInGeneSet>
    <biostatArc>2</biostatArc>
    <biostatCpx>6</biostatCpx>
    <biostatMet>-4</biostatMet>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="VEF.Genes.GeneExtension">
        <backgroundPathArchite>UI/Icons/Genes/GeneBackground_ArchotechHardware</backgroundPathArchite>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
  </GeneDef>

</Defs>
